msgstr ""

#: blocks/retrogrades/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid "All eight planets that station, and what each is doing today."
msgstr "جميع الكواكب الثمانية التي تتوقف، وماذا تفعل كل واحدة منها اليوم."

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Rising Sign (AstroWay)"
msgstr "برج الطلوع (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "rising"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "ascendant"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/rising-sign/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"The rising sign with its chart ruler. Needs coordinates: the ascendant is "
"the horizon at a place."
msgstr ""
"برج الطلوع مع حاكمه الكوكبي. يحتاج إلى إحداثيات: الأفق هو الأفق في مكان "
"معين."

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Solar Return (AstroWay)"
msgstr "العودة الشمسية (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "solar return"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "birthday"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "year ahead"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/solar-return/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"The chart of the moment the Sun returns to its birth position in a given "
"year, drawn into the page. Without a birth date it asks the visitor. Needs a"
" site key or an API key."
msgstr ""
"خريطة لحظة عودة الشمس إلى موضعها عند الميلاد في عام محدد، مرسومة داخل "
"الصفحة. من دون تاريخ الميلاد تسأل الزائر عنه. تحتاج إلى مفتاح الموقع أو "
"مفتاح API."

#: blocks/synastry/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Synastry Compatibility (AstroWay)"
msgstr "خريطة الميلاد (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/synastry/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "synastry"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/synastry/block.json blocks/zodiac-compatibility/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "love"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/synastry/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Compatibility score and the cross-aspects behind it for two birth charts, "
"rendered into the page by api.astroway.info. No key needed."
msgstr ""
"درجة التوافق والجوانب المتداخلة الكامنة وراءها لخريطتي ميلاد، تم عرضها على "
"الصفحة بواسطة api.astroway.info. لا حاجة إلى مفتاح تفسير."

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Tarot Spread of the Day (AstroWay)"
msgstr "انتشار التاروت لليوم (AstroWay)"

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "spread"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "celtic cross"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/tarot-spread/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Three cards or the Celtic Cross, drawn once a day for this site, each card "
"read in its position. A visitor can draw again."
msgstr ""
"ثلاث بطاقات أو الصليب السلتي، تُسحب مرة في اليوم لهذا الموقع، وتُقرأ كل "
"بطاقة في موضعها. يمكن للزائر السحب مرة أخرى."

#: blocks/transit-timeline/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
